        "title": "Psa 92:1-15 . A Psalm-song--(see on Psa 30:1 , title). The theme: God should be praised for His righteous judgments on the wicked and His care and defense of His people. Such a topic, at all times proper, is specially so for the reflections of the Sabbath day."
